 "title": "L79xxC: 1.5 A fixed negative voltage regulators, -5, -8, -12 and -15 V",
 "source": {
  "document": "Doc ID 2149",
  "revision": "Rev 21, May 2012",
  "pages": 24
 },
 "summary": "Three-terminal linear regulators for fixed negative rails of -5, -8, -12 or -15 V at up to 1.5 A, built-in limits on current, temperature and pass-transistor stress. They are the negative partners of the L78xx and come in TO-220 (Single or Dual Gauge frame), TO-220FP and D²PAK. Dropout is about 1.1 V at 1 A. L7912CV-DG is the -12 V part in TO-220 on the Dual Gauge frame.",
